'''Random Painted Seers''' are [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knives that are obtainable by [[crafting]] them through the crafting station using 10 godly [[metals]] {{Crafting|Godly Metal}} and 10 godly [[shards]] {{Crafting|Godly Shard}}. They are reskins of the godly knife [[Seer]], and were first introduced by [[Nikilis]] after the release of [[Season 1]].

