==Trivia==
*To obtain the required materials to craft one, players would need to salvage at least ten [[Seer|Seers]] and a [[Godly Weapons|godly weapon]].
*They were released along with the [[Season 1]] update. However, instead of being placed under the Season 1 section, they are placed under the Classic section in a player’s inventory.
*Out of the six painted seers, [[Chroma Seer]] is the most difficult to craft due to it being the rarest and having the slimmest chance of crafting.

